WEBVTT

00:23:55.276 --> 00:24:00.756
is to encourage young individuals
to consider a career in medicine,

00:24:00.796 --> 00:24:02.876
science and public health,

00:24:02.916 --> 00:24:07.036
because the opportunities
are really limitless.

00:24:07.436 --> 00:24:13.316
We are at a stage now the likes of which
people who antidated us

00:24:13.356 --> 00:24:15.076
never would have imagined

00:24:15.116 --> 00:24:17.716
the opportunities in science that we have.

00:24:17.756 --> 00:24:20.636
So I'm very optimistic
about where we're going.

00:24:21.036 --> 00:24:22.636
DB: Me, too.

00:24:23.036 --> 00:24:26.716
But you mentioned earlier how
climate change is affecting pandemics.

00:24:26.756 --> 00:24:31.316
What worries you about the future
that we're facing?